        "text": "theorem movingStrip_zeta_le_one {coord a b cL cR : ℝ} (U : SlowRegion coord)\n    (ha : 0 < a) (hcL : 0 < cL) (hcR : 0 < cR)\n    (ε L : ℕ → ℝ) (hε : ∀ n, 0 < ε n) (hεone : ∀ n, ε n ≤ 1) (hL : ∀ n, 1 ≤ L n)\n    (x : MeanStateRegularity.Point) :\n    (movingStripData U a b cL cR ha hcL hcR ε L hε hεone hL).zeta x ≤ 1"
